  </h2>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.8;">
    <li>
      ITAC statistically combines five school-level measures of teacher academic ability that research says are related to student achievement (Mean = 0.0, SD = 1.0):
    </li>
  </ul>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px;">
    <thead>
